    - target: {fileID: 5912584211440286702, guid: 7cc92fc86676e914d87ddb821614609c, type: 3}
      propertyPath: m_text
      value: "Afet an\u0131nda do\u011Fru ve anl\u0131k kararlar vermek hayat kurtar\u0131r.
        Bir \xE7\u0131\u011F veya heyelan\u0131n yakla\u015Ft\u0131\u011F\u0131n\u0131
        ilk duyaca\u011F\u0131n\u0131z o derinden gelen u\u011Fultu ve k\u0131r\u0131lma
        sesinden anlayabilirsiniz. Bu sesi duydu\u011Funuz an saniyeler i\xE7inde
        harekete ge\xE7melisiniz!\n\nKa\xE7\u0131\u015F esnas\u0131nda asla a\u011Fa\xE7lar\u0131n
        yan\u0131na yakla\u015Fmay\u0131n; tonlarca a\u011F\u0131rl\u0131ktaki kar\u0131n
        bask\u0131s\u0131yla devrilebilirler. E\u011Fer a\xE7\u0131k alanda yakalan\u0131rsan\u0131z,
        rotan\u0131z \xFCzerindeki b\xFCy\xFCk ve sabit kayalar\u0131n arkas\u0131na
        siper alabilirsiniz."
      objectReference: {fileID: 0}
